<p>During the reign of Dharmaraja the district was improved by all means. Raja Kesava Das, the then Diwan of Travancore who was known as the "Maker of modern Alleppey" made Alappuzha a premier port town of Travancore.<a href="Kerala-Destinations/Alleppey.aspx">MORE...</a> 
