<p>Bangalore is draped over the Deccan Plateau at an altitude of 949 meters (3113 ft.) above sea level, which gives it possibly the best climate among all the cities in India. Legend has it that Bangalore got its name from the words "Bendha KaaLu".<a href="Karnataka-Destinations/Bangalore.aspx">MORE...</a></p> 
