<p>It is located at the Malabar Coast in the Northern part of the state of Kerala. It is a beautiful city. The city has a large number of visitor's attractions which include places of worship, beaches, backwaters, waterfalls and museums.<a href="Kerala-Destinations/Calicut.aspx">MORE...</a> </p>
