<p>Kottayam is an enchanting city situated south of Cochin in the state of Kerala. A city of many contrasts and convolutions, while one part of the place is a busy commercial centre, the other promises a wholesome dose of repose and relaxation with shimmering backwaters and lush greenery.<a href="Kerala-Destinations/Kottayam.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
