<p>When the name Kozhikode strikes your ears the images and thoughts of greenery with cool breeze cuddling you conquer your mind. Tourists enjoy each and every moment amid the nature.<a href="Kerala-Destinations/Kozhikode.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
