<p>The vibrant history of the city of Chennai which was previously named as Madras, traces back to 368 years and Chennai was originally a tiny fishing village. The region surrounding Chennai has served as a significant administrative,<a href="Tamil-Nadu-Destinations/Chennai.aspx">MORE...</a> </p>
