<p>Coimbatore is one of the fastest growing and the second largest city of Tamil Nadu. Coimbatore is often referred to as 'The Manchester of South' because of its ever growing textile industry.It is situated on the banks of the river Noyyal.<a href="Tamil-Nadu-Destinations/Coimbatore.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
