<p>The city of a Thousand Temples Ancient Kanchipuram is one of the most holy pilgrim centers for the Hindus. Kancheepuram is admired for its prominent crafted world famous silk sarees, a traditional home industry.<a href="Tamil-Nadu-Destinations/Kancheepuram.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
