<p>The summer getaway of Britishers, Ooty is presently one of the most popular hill stations in South India. For all those who want to beat the heat, this Queen of Hill Stations stands with extended arms to gift all with a very memorable vacation.<a href="Tamil-Nadu-Destinations/Ooty.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
