<p>Guntur holds pride of place blessed with an abundance of nature's treasures such as hills, valleys, rivers and beaches, an important region where Buddhism flourished in the early centuries. The cosmopolitan culture, the historical and modern artifacts,<a href="Andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/Guntur.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
