<p>Hyderabad, the capital of Andhra Pradesh is a bustling 400 year old metropolis with an urban population of 4.2 million people approximately. The city is cosmopolitan, and is richly endowed with a variety of cultures.<a href="Andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/Hyderabad.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
