<p>Secunderabad was named after Sikander Jah, the third Nizam of the Asaf Jahi dynasty. It is situated about 10 km on the east of its 'twin city' Hyderabad. The two cities are connected by the road on the bund of the beautiful Hussain Sagar Lake.<a href="Andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/Secunderabad.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
