<p>The city popularly referred as The Jewel of the East Coast is situated between the twigs of nest of the hills of the Eastern Ghats seeing Bay of Bengal. Visakhapatnam is often also called The City of Destiny.<a href="Andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/Vishakapatnam.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
