<p>Vijayawada is located on the banks of river Krishna in the beautiful coastal line of AndhraPradesh, a southern state of India . Also known as Bezawada, this predominantly business city attracts many piligrims for its temple dedicated to Durga <a href="Andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/Vijayawada.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
